 Elder editable geometry is `model-sources/gnome_elder.bbmodel` with custom polygon meshes (71 parts/2428 triangles). Bake to `assets/syntacticwizardry/meshes/gnome_elder.swmesh` with `python3 tools/bake_gnome_elder_mesh.py`. Texture: `textures/entity/gnome_elder.png`. It wears a blue robe/hood and holds a sculpted Iron Runecaster. The entity also has an Iron Runecaster in main hand for game data. This model uses the custom triangle renderer rather than a standard GeckoLib cuboid export.
 
