+During combat the Elder uses its spells through the existing Push (`MoveEffect`), Physical Damage (`DamageEffect`), and Alter (`AlterEffect`) backends. Push: Target Entities / Push 4, 5 mana, 70-tick cooldown, range 5. Damage: Target Entities / Physical 6, 21 mana, 45-tick cooldown, range 14. Alter: Sphere Radius 2 / Strength +1, Speed +1, Toughness +1; cast only if no player overlaps the sphere; only village allies gain the bonuses; 30 seconds duration and 600-tick cooldown. Cost is derived from SpellManaCost's standard sphere voxel count. Default and maximum Elder Mana is 100; Mana is persistent and consumed. The Elder regenerates Mana as specified below.
 
 **Not implemented:** Gnome Village structure generation or guaranteeing precisely one Elder per generated village. That requires a separate worldgen design. This release supports group affiliation of manually spawned Gnomes.
+
+## v0.3.79: Passive Mana regeneration
+
+The Elder regenerates 0.25 Mana per second (0.25 every 20 server ticks). Regeneration happens outside and during combat, persists across saves, and stops at 100 Mana. Regular Gnomes currently have no Mana resource.
